        "lib": "habitat lib",
        "old": "v1",
        "new": "v2",
        "rollback": 5,
        "rollout_label": "rolling out v2, service by service…",
        "outage_label": "rolled back → outage",
        "service": "habitat service"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "python",
      "type": "gantt",
      "duration_s": 10,
      "narration": [
        "They kept the service in Python, knowing a rewrite would come later.",
        "Python's asyncio can wait on many requests at once, but runs one request's code at a time.",
        "With heavy CPU work, responses already back from the database sit waiting their turn.",
        "The fix: keep each process to a few requests at once, and run many more processes."
      ],
