      "type": "balance",
      "duration_s": 10,
      "narration": [
        "Then a strange one: after a traffic burst, a few servers stayed overloaded, and kept getting worse.",
        "The connection pool reused the most recently returned connection first.",
        "Slow servers return their connections last, so they kept getting picked, and got slower still.",
        "Reusing the oldest connection first broke the loop."
      ],
